                    insight_focused:        `Model focus paid off: a single, coherent, mission-fit model gave the lead fund one clear thing to underwrite — the strategic act of choosing under scarcity, exactly as the case intends.`,

                    hint_funding:           `You're still short of the €750k minimum close. Revisit the financing stack — the +€250k (negotiated) or the BPI loan plus an angel top-up reach it; a burn cut alone does not.`,
